# CivicTrace trust rules

- Evidence workspace first: cite Hansard/news; do not invent political certainty.
- Never add “live verified”, fake accuracy, or loyalty scores without measured eval + human review.
- Data load failures must surface errors; never silently fall back to demo data.
- Missing evidence is not a broken promise; Hansard proves speech, not truth.
- Keep secrets server-side only; never put DB URIs or API keys in `VITE_*` or fixtures.
- Prefer extending provenance and review fields over decorative UI or composite rankings.
- Read `docs/PRD.md`, `docs/SRS.md`, and `AGENTS.md` before large feature work.
